---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Stop Using the Garbage Casters That Came With Your Chair: Lifelong Rollerblade Wheels Review — TestedByTom" description="No tools. No hassle. Pop the old ones out, pop these in, and wonder why every chair doesn't ship with these.">
<style>
  main {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .breadcrumb a { color: var(--rust); text-decoration: none; }
  .breadcrumb a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .breadcrumb span { margin: 0 0.4rem; }

  .post-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--rust);
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .hero-image {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-info h1 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brown);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .key-stats {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .stat-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .stat-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .stat-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .stat-value {
    color: var(--brown);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .stat-score {
    color: var(--rust);
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .buy-btn {
    display: block;
    background: var(--rust);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: background 0.15s;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .buy-btn:hover { background: #a34422; }

  .ftc-note {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ── BODY ── */
  .post-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--brown);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .post-body p { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brown);
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }
  .feature-list li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--brown);
  }
  .feature-list li::before {
    content: '✓';
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .callout {
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--rust);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--brown);
  }
  .callout strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--rust);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
  }

  /* ── RATING ── */
  .rating-section {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .rating-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rust);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .rating-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .rating-name {
    min-width: 140px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .rating-stars { color: var(--rust); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .rating-score { font-weight: 700; color: var(--brown); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .rating-final {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .final-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .final-score {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--rust);
  }
  .rating-notes {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--rust);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>

<main>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span>
    <a href="/must-haves">Must-Haves</a><span>›</span>
    Rollerblade Office Chair Wheels
  </div>

  <span class="post-tag">Must-Have · Office</span>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-image">
      <img src="/images/rollerblade-casters.png" alt="Lifelong Rollerblade Office Chair Casters — set of 5" />
    </div>

    <div class="hero-info">
      <h1>Stop Using the Garbage Casters That Came With Your Chair</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">No tools. No hassle. Pop the old ones out, pop these in, and wonder why every chair doesn't ship with these.</p>

      <div class="key-stats">
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="stat-label">Brand</span>
          <span class="stat-value">Lifelong</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="stat-label">Qty</span>
          <span class="stat-value">Set of 5</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="stat-label">Works On</span>
          <span class="stat-value">Hard floors, carpet, rugs</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="stat-label">Tools Required</span>
          <span class="stat-value">None</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <span class="stat-label">Tom's Rating</span>
          <span class="stat-score">5.00 / 5</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Office-Replacement-Casters-Hardwood-Replace/dp/B01G643EU6?linkCode=sl2&tag=howlatecanwes-20&linkId=4675a1e499608e54b837cc25edf61d32&language=en_US&ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="buy-btn">
        Buy on Amazon →
      </a>
      <p class="ftc-note">Affiliate link — I earn a small commission at no cost to you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="post-body">
    <p>It should be a crime. Every office chair manufacturer ships their chairs with the same cheap plastic casters that barely roll on a good day, scratch your floors, snag on carpet, and feel like you're pushing a grocery cart with a broken wheel. You paid real money for that chair. The wheels are an afterthought.</p>

    <p>These rollerblade-style wheels fix all of it in about two minutes with zero tools. Pull the old ones out, push the new ones in. Done. Your chair will glide like it was always supposed to.</p>

    <div class="section-title">Why These Are Better</div>

    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>Rollerblade-style polyurethane wheels roll smooth on everything — hardwood, tile, carpet, rugs. No more fighting your own chair.</li>
      <li>They're quiet. The cheap plastic casters clack and scrape. These are silent.</li>
      <li>They won't scratch your floors. The soft urethane material is floor-safe, unlike hard plastic.</li>
      <li>Universal fit — the standard stem size fits virtually every office chair made in the last 20 years.</li>
      <li>No tools required. The stems pop straight into the same holes as your old casters.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>How to install</strong>
      Tip your chair on its side. Grab the old caster stem and pull straight out — they're just friction-fit, so a firm tug does it. If they're stuck, wiggle side to side while pulling. Push the new one straight in until it clicks. Repeat four more times. Flip the chair back over. That's it.
    </div>

    <p>I replaced the casters on every chair in the house. Then I pulled the old ones out of the recycling and used them for the <a href="/household-tips/pallet-roller-stand" style="color:var(--rust);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;">pallet roller stand in the garage</a>. Nothing wasted.</p>

    <p>Cheap, fast, and one of those upgrades where you immediately wonder why you didn't do it sooner. If you have an office chair, just do this.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="rating-section">
    <div class="rating-label">Honest Rating</div>
    <div class="rating-row">
      <span class="rating-name">Ease of Use</span>
      <span class="rating-stars">★★★★★</span>
      <span class="rating-score">5/5</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rating-row">
      <span class="rating-name">Learning Curve</span>
      <span class="rating-stars">★★★★★</span>
      <span class="rating-score">5/5</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rating-row">
      <span class="rating-name">Results</span>
      <span class="rating-stars">★★★★★</span>
      <span class="rating-score">5/5</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rating-row">
      <span class="rating-name">Versatility</span>
      <span class="rating-stars">★★★★★</span>
      <span class="rating-score">5/5</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rating-final">
      <span class="final-label">Final Score</span>
      <span class="final-score">5.00 / 5</span>
    </div>
    <p class="rating-notes">Simple, cheap, and makes your chair feel like a completely different product. No tools, no hassle, instant upgrade. Should be standard on every chair — it's criminal that it isn't.</p>
  </div>

  <a href="/must-haves" class="back-link">← Back to Must-Haves</a>
</main>
</Layout>
